===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[apparent]] [[magnitude]]}}

# {{lb|en|astronomy}} a [[numerical]] [[measure]] of the [[brightness]] of a [[star]], [[planet]] etc.; a [[decrease]] of 1 [[unit]] represents an [[increase]] in the [[light]] [[received]] by a [[factor]] of 2.512

